                                                "sense_id": "464d4fc0-1875-3678-9ad0-e97e63dfaf45",
                                                "text": "My suggestion is to read http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Copyright_violations to see our mechanism that deals with copyvios."
